            "trait_name": {
              "value": "False Faith"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Abridan is an ex-cleric. While he's lost the magical abilities that come from his connection to Pharasma, he can still use the major staff of healing or any of his scrolls by tricking the item. Since he can't cast spells, he can't recharge his staff, and uses its remaining charges only as a last resort."
